text = "# CREDITS
This is my first game, excluding a game made by following a tutorial.

I made this game entirely on my own in approximately **15–20 hours**, 
with no prior experience in game development or pixel art. 
The only experience I had going into this was coding, which I believe is 
where I performed the best throughout this project.

I also have my midterms next week, so balancing this project alongside
 studying was definitely an experience in itself.

Despite having no previous experience in either pixel art or game development,
I wanted to challenge myself, learn something new, 
and see what I could create within the given time.

### ASSETS & ART

All visual assets, including the pixel art, sprites, and other in-game artwork,
 were made entirely by me.Added a lot of features that went unsued like box pushing etc.

I followed the given color palette throughout the project and tried my
 best to stay within its limitations. Wanted to add animations as well but didnt have time sadly.

The only external asset I used was the music and font.

**Music and font:** `leberch-chill603151` from Pixaby
, Pixelify font.
Everything else was created by me.

Thank you for playing!"
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
